 "id": "trouble",
 "text": "The ledger cannot tell her. Favourite tomes run out. A bookwyrm is found asleep in Herbalism after consuming several books for breakfast, very full, and not at all sorry. And last week, a signed first edition bit a knight. Not a book. A mimic. Pip, the clerk, ran to the tavern to find adventurers to vanquish it. A price was agreed in haste. Nobody wrote it down.",
